{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51975","headline":"西江月（六首。以下词）（原八首，前二首已见《全唐诗》，此六首，《全宋词》亦未收。） 六 · 吕岩","name":"西江月（六首。以下词）（原八首，前二首已见《全唐诗》，此六首，《全宋词》亦未收。） 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彼此离於生处，火遭水破惊忙。\n分身各自拟深藏，半路再遣萧郎。\n夫爲无衣素体，妻因水浸衣黄。\n丙丁甲乙有形相，刚遣令合阴阳。\n（《古今图书集成·神异典》三○二《静功部》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51975.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51975","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}